- §4.1 Ex 37 — no proper nontrivial subgroups ⇒ cyclic: needs ⟨g⟩ parameterized by
  a VARIABLE generator (std/cyclic.bpa fixes its generator as a const).

### matrices (GL₂) / concrete permutation-quaternion groups
- §4.1 Ex 4, 14 — subgroups / orders in GL₂(ℝ) (matrix sort).
- §4.1 Ex 6, 7, 8 — orders in D₄; cyclic subgroups of Q₈, U(30).

### repeated-squares numerics (§4.3)
